00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:01.170
I could wait a little longer for the sweets money.

00:12:01.170 --> 00:12:04.540
Nagomi, I'm sending you out to do a job for us!

00:12:04.750 --> 00:12:06.130
Oh, sure!

00:12:06.130 --> 00:12:07.540
