00:12:28.250 --> 00:12:29.250
Oh jeez...

00:12:29.960 --> 00:12:31.750
Will you go for us?

00:12:31.750 --> 00:12:32.960
Sure!

00:12:32.960 --> 00:12:34.750
I'll do my best to do a good job!

00:12:34.750 --> 00:12:38.330
