00:12:38.710 --> 00:12:40.130
Really, I feel bad.

00:12:40.130 --> 00:12:41.460
I'm super sorry!

00:12:41.460 --> 00:12:43.290
Not at all!
Leave it to me.

00:12:45.710 --> 00:12:47.380
What's up, Ranko?

00:12:47.750 --> 00:12:50.040
