00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:22.920
RAMEN

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:32.790
Excuse me, can I get one soy milk tofu skin ramen?

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:34.000
Ain't got that.

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:38.290
Ramen: Extra veggies, topped with sauce,
fat, and a load of garlic.

00:13:40.080 --> 00:13:41.500
Same as ever, eh?

00:13:44.330 --> 00:13:48.420
Yumechi's Oinky Doink drink is really so good!

00:13:48.750 --> 00:13:51.750
I guess she has a special way of infusing it with moe?

00:13:52.290 --> 00:13:55.750
I want to try harder so I can be of use to the cafe!

00:13:56.710 --> 00:14:01.670
But anyway, I think it's amazing that
you're a maid at thirty-five, Ranko!

00:14:02.830 --> 00:14:04.330
Thank you for the food!

00:14:16.920 --> 00:14:18.130
Duly received.

00:14:18.920 --> 00:14:21.330
You think they'll get back safely?

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:22.880
Who cares if they do?

00:14:22.880 --> 00:14:24.170
They both suck at work.

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:26.920
Wow! That's cold, Yumechi.

00:14:26.920 --> 00:14:29.710
Hey, do you two believe in miracles?

00:14:30.210 --> 00:14:31.420
Miracles?

00:14:31.420 --> 00:14:33.880
See, I can picture it somehow:

00:14:33.880 --> 00:14:38.000
a future where those two are smiling
and working with us as maids.

00:14:38.420 --> 00:14:40.630
Then why're you drafting up a flyer?

00:14:40.750 --> 00:14:46.170
Urgently hiring

00:14:40.750 --> 00:14:46.170
