00:14:46.630 --> 00:14:47.830
Huh?

00:14:53.710 --> 00:14:55.920
Wuv-Wuv Moonbeam

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:03.920
Hop on over again!

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:08.210
Wow! It's so pretty!

00:15:10.420 --> 00:15:11.830
Five more hops

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:15.500
Permission to speak.

00:15:15.500 --> 00:15:19.080
#96, my name is Ranko Mannen from Oinky Doink Cafe.

00:15:19.080 --> 00:15:20.540
