00:15:20.540 --> 00:15:21.830
We're here on an errand!

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:26.290
I'll go check.

00:15:26.290 --> 00:15:27.540
Just wait hare.

00:15:32.380 --> 00:15:35.710
