00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:48.710
Nooo! Spare me!

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:50.710
Just lop it off already!

00:15:57.630 --> 00:15:59.170
Are you shitting me?!

00:15:59.170 --> 00:16:01.500
Straight from the roots, damn it!

00:16:02.630 --> 00:16:04.750
NOOOOO!

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:08.500
My pigtail! My beautiful pigtail!

00:16:08.790 --> 00:16:12.080
NOOOOO!

00:16:14.540 --> 00:16:16.750
I apologize for the wait, Mistresses.

00:16:17.170 --> 00:16:18.960
What brings you hare today?

00:16:19.540 --> 00:16:20.750
Uh, well...

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:25.130
Um, h-here!

00:16:37.630 --> 00:16:39.040
Read it out.

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:40.250
Hop-kay!

00:16:43.830 --> 00:16:46.540
"Yo, roaches with your stupid antennae.

00:16:46.540 --> 00:16:48.000
Prepare to be exterminated.

00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:51.000
From everyone at Oinky Doink Cafe."

00:16:56.080 --> 00:16:58.540
Tell me, what do these look like to you?

00:16:59.710 --> 00:17:02.170
These things on our heads?

00:17:02.920 --> 00:17:06.080
E-ears, bunny ears...

00:17:14.250 --> 00:17:16.670
Damn right they're bunny ears!

00:17:16.670 --> 00:17:18.420
Got something to say for yerself?!

00:17:18.630 --> 00:17:21.040
No, um, I don't!

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:25.130
Stop snorting and speak up!

00:17:25.210 --> 00:17:26.460
I-I'm sorr...

00:17:26.460 --> 00:17:28.000
I can't hear you!

00:17:46.290 --> 00:17:47.500
No!

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:52.380
No!

00:18:03.330 --> 00:18:06.630
Oh, I never took my paper bib off.

00:18:06.630 --> 00:18:08.130
